            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Katie Clark"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Instead of using grapefruit juice, I used a 24 ounce jar of grapefruit segments and juice and I also subbed the blueberries for a mix of raspberries, marionberries, and blueberries. I blended everything and put it into my icecream maker for 20 minutes and it turned out WONDERFUL!! Its already half gone after less than 24 hours :)"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kristen Hoyle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe that allowed me to use fresh blueberries from the garden. I like a tart sorbet so I only used 1 cup of sugar. Other reviewers questioned if the alcohol needed to be added and it does - it keeps ice crystals from forming. I only used 1/4 cup of gin (didn't have vodka on hand). Whatever alcohol you use, make sure it is good quality or you will get a bitter after taste.",
            "datePublished": "2019-06-20T00:08:21.140Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Betsey Norland"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is delicious! It took a really long time to freeze, probably because I added the vodka. I might try leaving it out next time, to see if that makes a difference in the consistency. It never did freeze really solid, and you had to eat it quickly before it melted. But it was really yummy! A relatively guilt-free sweet treat.",
            "datePublished": "2012-07-19T07:02:26.180Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dawn Marie Downour"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was given a bottle of grapefruit juice and didn't like it. But I am not one to make waste. I made this in the blender with frozen blueberries and no vodka. I poured it into an ice cream maker and has a wonderful sorbet 20 minutes later.",
